  "notes": [
    "Keep all key values in environment variables or a secret manager; never commit secrets.",
    "Gemini keys belonging to the same Google AI project share project-level quota; keep quota_group the same for that project.",
    "OpenRouter keys for the same account do not multiply that account's global rate limits; keep quota_group the same for that account.",
    "Use distinct quota_group values only for independently quota-limited projects/accounts confirmed by the provider.",
    "An OmniRoute client key authenticates to the gateway and is not an upstream Gemini/OpenAI key.",
    "The number of rows is illustrative, not a system limit. Add or remove rows freely; the loader and pool builder accept any configured count.",
    "The host can merge authorized in-memory credential objects from Abacus, OmniRoute, and direct provider settings; this library does not inspect another app's private config automatically."
